## Numbers
@narrator{when="run.i + 2 == 5 && run.d * 2.0 >= 7.0"}: arithmetic
@narrator{when="run.i / 2 == 1 && run.i % 2 == 1"}: integer division
@narrator{when="run.i < 4 ? true : false"}: ternary
@narrator{when="-run.i < 0 && run.i in [1, 2, 3]"}: unary and list
